    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "UK printer based in Paddock Wood, Kent, specialising in short-run luxury print on premium stocks. Litho and digital presses plus extensive in-house finishing (hot foiling, embossing, die-cutting, binding, box-making, screen print). A print-production vendor (supplier capability), not a design studio. Notable clients include Google, JA Resorts & Hotels, Fife Arms Hotel and The Hurlingham Club (per LinkedIn and IG). Size 11-40 (nearest schema band; LinkedIn lists 11-50 employees). Contact info@identityprint.co.uk, +44 1892 837989. Work images sourced from Instagram (@identityprint, 400 posts, 3.8K followers); website interior pages all 500-error so no site-side images were available. Hi-res IG capture queued for a logged-in ig.py pass (state/ig-queue.json); current work images are 640px logged-out grid grabs.",
